WEBVTT

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.727
Too bad for you.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.688
You're just a little kid now,
Dark Schneider.

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:26.651
Killing him like this will be just as easy
as taking candy from a baby.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:29.904
I hope you realize
no one will save you now!

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:32.365
No. Kai!

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:39.080
Once I rid the world of him,
I will be unstoppable!

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:44.002
It'll be so fun to finally taste the blood
of Kall-Su and Nei

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.421
Kai! Kai!

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.640
Lucien, no!

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.601
What? What is this?

00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:44.455
BLUE NAIL

00:02:51.087 --> 00:02:52.213
Amazing.

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:55.133
The ninja army
is as good as the rumors say.

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:57.802
They're holding the horde of goblins back.

00:02:57.886 --> 00:03:00.221
Their sword skills are incredible.

00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:01.389
Yes.

00:03:01.472 --> 00:03:04.309
And one person,
in particular, is quite impressive.

00:03:05.101 --> 00:03:07.437
Ugh.
There's no end to these goblins.

00:03:08.229 --> 00:03:09.063
Hey!

00:03:09.647 --> 00:03:11.858
You mind stepping aside for a minute?

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:23.077
Their leader,
the Ninja Master Gara!

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.873
That did the trick.

00:03:30.835 --> 00:03:34.088
Come on. This is getting real old for me.

00:03:34.172 --> 00:03:36.716
What's taking him so long?
I don't have all day.

00:03:44.515 --> 00:03:47.101
Let me out!

00:03:47.185 --> 00:03:50.230
Let me out of this cage!

00:03:52.649 --> 00:03:54.567
Wait. But how?

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:58.905
Did that pathetic brat faint in fear?

00:03:58.988 --> 00:04:00.740
I'm so scared!

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:04.661
Yoko, get me out of here!
You have to help me!

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:06.246
You damn vampire!

00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:09.457
Let me out of here so I can destroy you!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.168
I'm so scared, Yoko! Please, help me!

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:15.046
-I can't take this anymore!
-He's awake?

00:04:15.129 --> 00:04:18.341
No way.
Then how is Dark Schneider talking?

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:19.592
<i>It's impossible!</i>

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:22.428
Does this mean
they can exist at the same time?

00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:27.475
Yoko, you have to help me!

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.185
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:32.522
<i>The power of Lucien's consciousness</i>
<i>and the sealing spell combined</i>

00:04:32.605 --> 00:04:34.941
<i>are barely keeping Dark Schneider at bay.</i>

00:04:36.859 --> 00:04:39.237
Go ahead and threaten me all you want,

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.533
but it's far too late for you to escape
from here now, you pathetic child!

00:04:44.742 --> 00:04:48.663
Once I suck Sean Ari's blood,
my power will double.

00:04:50.748 --> 00:04:54.377
I'm not worried
about Dark Schneider in the slightest!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.712
Oh, no!

00:04:55.795 --> 00:04:56.963
Time to drink!

00:04:57.046 --> 00:04:58.798
Drink this!

00:05:02.176 --> 00:05:05.888
Demon, you won't lay a single finger
on her while I'm here!

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:12.145
You little brat! How dare you kick me!

00:05:12.228 --> 00:05:14.564
Don't you understand
I'm a noble gentleman?

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:16.566
And if you ruin my beautiful face…

00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:17.734
Uh…

00:05:18.735 --> 00:05:20.236
…I'll kill you!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.202
It's time.

00:05:28.703 --> 00:05:30.496
We need your power now.

00:05:31.372 --> 00:05:32.582
Dark Schneider!

00:05:46.429 --> 00:05:47.305
No way!

00:05:50.099 --> 00:05:53.019
What's this? No way! Impossible!

00:05:53.102 --> 00:05:54.228
Did he…?

00:05:55.772 --> 00:05:56.898
It can't be!

00:06:00.068 --> 00:06:02.320
Dark Schneider!

00:06:02.403 --> 00:06:04.405
I can't believe my eyes!

00:06:04.489 --> 00:06:07.533
You were actually able
to break the seal on your own?

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:10.161
I knew he would come.

00:06:10.244 --> 00:06:11.245
<i>Wait.</i>

00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:13.206
<i>He broke free?</i>

00:06:14.207 --> 00:06:15.708
<i>Dark Schneider.</i>

00:06:15.792 --> 00:06:18.336
<i>The ancient sorcerer who lives in darkness</i>

00:06:18.419 --> 00:06:20.630
<i>and rules over death and destruction.</i>

00:06:21.172 --> 00:06:23.007
<i>His power is infinite!</i>

00:06:23.925 --> 00:06:27.762
The kid in the cage escaped
and changed into this guy.

00:06:27.845 --> 00:06:31.224
And he's actually the legendary sorcerer?

00:06:31.307 --> 00:06:32.642
He's Dark Schneider?

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:38.815
Oh no! Take a look
at that evil smirk on his face!

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:41.734
Yeah. I've never seen someone
who looks so evil before.

00:06:41.818 --> 00:06:43.069
Have any of you guys?

00:06:43.152 --> 00:06:45.071
I've never seen a guy
with a face like that.

00:06:45.154 --> 00:06:48.199
He's gotta be twisted, right?

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:51.869
How dare you hurt my women, you idiot!

00:06:52.453 --> 00:06:55.498
And to top it all off,
you even kicked Yoko.

00:06:55.581 --> 00:06:57.542
How dare you hurt her!

00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:00.920
Someday she'll be the woman
who bears my children!

00:07:01.003 --> 00:07:01.921
Huh?

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.259
Ugh. What an idiot.

00:07:06.342 --> 00:07:10.471
Wait. Did he really just say
what I think he just said?

00:07:13.224 --> 00:07:14.475
Kai!

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:17.311
You are a monster!

00:07:17.395 --> 00:07:19.313
I'll destroy you!

00:07:19.397 --> 00:07:24.694
Su, han, to, ste, lu.

00:07:26.195 --> 00:07:27.321
Not that spell!

00:07:27.405 --> 00:07:29.615
Die, monster!

00:07:30.658 --> 00:07:32.034
Riot!

00:07:35.371 --> 00:07:38.624
That's an advanced form
of the Balvolt spell!

00:07:42.545 --> 00:07:44.714
<i>Lightning spells and cooling spells</i>

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:48.468
<i>are two of the only types of magic</i>
<i>that work against vampires.</i>

00:07:48.551 --> 00:07:50.803
<i>There's no way</i>
<i>that spell didn't injure him.</i>

00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:54.891
Oh no! Count!

00:07:54.974 --> 00:07:56.767
Count, are you okay?

00:08:00.271 --> 00:08:03.441
Is that all Dark Schneider's capable of?

00:08:03.524 --> 00:08:05.318
Too bad it didn't work.

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:11.032
I guess the legendary sorcerer
isn't as powerful as everyone says he is.

00:08:11.115 --> 00:08:13.034
Well, what a surprise.

00:08:15.536 --> 00:08:17.663
Oh no. No way.

00:08:18.831 --> 00:08:21.417
Oh, please. I can beat you!

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:23.127
You're not that strong.

00:08:23.211 --> 00:08:25.087
Isn't that right, Jodoh?

00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:30.092
<i>This is bad!</i>
<i>The vampire is too powerful.</i>

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:31.761
<i>Crosses don't work against him,</i>

00:08:31.844 --> 00:08:33.179
<i>so magic might not either.</i>

00:08:33.262 --> 00:08:35.848
<i>And he has an immortal body,</i>

00:08:35.932 --> 00:08:38.142
<i>so it's not</i>
<i>like we can use a weapon against him.</i>

00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:41.229
<i>Damn. What are we going to do?</i>

00:08:43.523 --> 00:08:45.733
I don't like your attitude.

00:08:45.816 --> 00:08:47.693
I can tell from your smug smile

00:08:47.777 --> 00:08:49.820
that you're looking down
on all of us right now

00:08:49.904 --> 00:08:52.573
like you actually think
you'll be able to defeat me.

00:08:52.657 --> 00:08:54.200
You're standing there thinking

00:08:54.283 --> 00:08:57.328
you're the most powerful person
in the whole world, aren't you?

00:08:58.871 --> 00:09:02.291
Well, yeah. Because I am
the most powerful person in the world.

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:04.460
Fine. Think what you want.

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:07.046
You act
like you're not afraid of anything.

00:09:07.129 --> 00:09:12.510
But only noble beings, such as myself,
deserve to have an ego as big as yours is.

00:09:12.593 --> 00:09:15.346
Today, I'll teach you the meaning of fear,

00:09:15.429 --> 00:09:18.558
and wipe that smug smile
right off your face.

00:09:18.641 --> 00:09:19.475
Understand?

00:09:21.727 --> 00:09:24.272
Give up now, vampire.
You don't stand a chance.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:28.276
Witness the magic of a noble!

00:09:29.694 --> 00:09:31.362
Whoa! Check it out!

00:09:31.445 --> 00:09:33.155
The Count's secret power!

00:09:33.239 --> 00:09:35.157
Assassin!

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:48.045
Did you see that? I did it, Jodoh!

00:09:48.129 --> 00:09:52.383
I killed the great sorcerer,
Dark Schneider, with my own spell!

00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:56.304
No!

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:58.264
Lucien.

00:09:58.347 --> 00:10:01.767
You're so amazing, Count!
What a fantastic comeback!

00:10:01.851 --> 00:10:03.019
He's incredible!

00:10:03.102 --> 00:10:05.730
There's no one better
than the almighty Count!

00:10:05.813 --> 00:10:08.733
I hope we could continue
to be of service to you.

00:10:10.985 --> 00:10:12.445
Why thank you, boys.

00:10:12.528 --> 00:10:15.948
I know you're all in awe of me
after witnessing my power.

00:10:16.032 --> 00:10:17.450
But don't just stand there.

00:10:17.533 --> 00:10:20.161
It's time for you to prove your worth

00:10:20.244 --> 00:10:22.538
and capture those female brats.

00:10:23.164 --> 00:10:25.207
Yes! As you wish!

00:10:27.752 --> 00:10:29.337
Don't resist!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.589
You'll make a great offering to the Count!

00:10:31.672 --> 00:10:33.799
You're so lucky he'll suck your blood!

00:10:35.843 --> 00:10:37.637
Talisman Magic!

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:40.139
-Huh?
-Rasho Red Hot Waltz!

00:10:43.267 --> 00:10:45.019
Insolent fool!

00:10:45.603 --> 00:10:49.649
Don't you realize there's no hope
for any of you to escape from here now?

00:10:49.732 --> 00:10:51.442
Stay back!

00:10:51.525 --> 00:10:53.611
I won't let you hurt Kai again!

00:10:53.694 --> 00:10:55.404
You silly girl!

00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:58.324
Dark Schneider was your last hope,
and look what happened to him.

00:10:58.949 --> 00:11:00.785
He's just a pile of meat.

00:11:07.833 --> 00:11:08.751
Huh?

00:11:17.051 --> 00:11:19.345
That's impossible! I thought I…

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:22.765
What's happening?

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:25.893
I can't… I can't feel my legs, Count!

00:11:25.976 --> 00:11:27.228
What have you done to me?

00:11:27.311 --> 00:11:29.730
Jodoh!

00:11:32.274 --> 00:11:33.359
What a dumbass!

00:11:33.442 --> 00:11:37.321
I can't believe you didn't even notice
how much I damaged your nervous system

00:11:37.405 --> 00:11:38.864
with my lightning spell.

00:11:38.948 --> 00:11:42.702
So now you won't be able to shoot
your magic in a straight line anymore.

00:11:44.537 --> 00:11:46.122
You bastard!

00:11:46.205 --> 00:11:48.332
How dare you mock me to my face?

00:11:48.416 --> 00:11:49.583
Damn you!

00:11:51.961 --> 00:11:54.255
What's wrong with you, O noble Count?

00:11:54.338 --> 00:11:56.632
Finally showing your true colors, huh?

00:11:56.716 --> 00:11:58.968
Who cares if I can't shoot straight?

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:02.221
Do you really think
that matters to me, you fool!

00:12:02.304 --> 00:12:03.180
Take this!

00:12:06.016 --> 00:12:08.853
Di-amon Rotating Assassin!

00:12:12.064 --> 00:12:13.607
Count! Please, stop!

00:12:16.902 --> 00:12:19.196
I can shoot magic in all directions!

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.823
There's no escape from me!

00:12:22.616 --> 00:12:26.996
There is only one
universal law in a fight between two men.

00:12:27.079 --> 00:12:28.205
Let me tell you.

00:12:28.289 --> 00:12:31.917
The ugly meathead never wins
against the young hero.

00:12:32.001 --> 00:12:34.712
Smart, handsome ladies man.

00:12:34.795 --> 00:12:35.838
You know the drill.

00:12:37.548 --> 00:12:38.674
Look at you.

00:12:38.758 --> 00:12:41.927
From the moment I saw your face,
I knew you would die.

00:12:43.554 --> 00:12:46.265
Shut up! I'm a beautiful noble!

00:12:50.227 --> 00:12:52.438
What?

00:12:55.649 --> 00:12:56.942
I'll give this back.

00:12:57.026 --> 00:12:58.986
No. No way.

00:12:59.069 --> 00:13:01.447
He managed to catch my magic spell.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:04.158
You're the real monster, bastard!

00:13:04.241 --> 00:13:05.993
I'm not a monster,

00:13:07.578 --> 00:13:08.829
you are!

00:13:14.376 --> 00:13:17.213
You idiot.
What exactly were you aiming for?

00:13:17.296 --> 00:13:18.756
Huh?

00:13:18.839 --> 00:13:19.840
Huh?

00:13:19.924 --> 00:13:21.050
No!

00:13:22.676 --> 00:13:24.804
The sun!

00:13:30.518 --> 00:13:32.061
So pathetic.

00:13:32.645 --> 00:13:35.523
Someone like you
could never hope to scare me.

00:13:35.606 --> 00:13:38.275
There's only one person
that I'm afraid of.

00:13:53.123 --> 00:13:53.999
Huh?

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.001
He's turning into ash.

00:14:03.884 --> 00:14:06.387
No, now. Not our Count.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.764
I can't believe
our Count got turned to ash.

00:14:11.308 --> 00:14:15.062
You did it! You beat Di-amon!
You destroyed the vampire for us!

00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:18.107
No. Not quite yet.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.775
Take a look.

00:14:24.154 --> 00:14:25.239
Hmm?

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.951
Did you forget
that a vampire's body

00:14:29.034 --> 00:14:32.788
is basically immortal, Dark Schneider?

00:14:32.872 --> 00:14:35.708
Hey. Look at that!
The Count has been resurrected!

00:14:35.791 --> 00:14:39.253
Uh, no. I don't think so.
That's a giant bat!

00:14:39.753 --> 00:14:42.756
Don't forget! I am a noble!

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.301
I am a true-blooded vampire!

00:14:45.384 --> 00:14:47.636
I am a ruler!

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:50.180
My name is Count Di-amon!

00:14:54.476 --> 00:14:55.811
Dark Schneider,

00:14:55.895 --> 00:14:59.440
you have no idea
where I could be now, do you?

00:15:00.482 --> 00:15:02.359
Hey, Count! Where are you?

00:15:02.443 --> 00:15:04.361
Yeah. Reveal yourself to us!

00:15:04.445 --> 00:15:05.863
Where the hell is he?

00:15:05.946 --> 00:15:08.616
I can't tell
where Di-amon's voice is coming from!

00:15:08.699 --> 00:15:09.575
You fool!

00:15:13.412 --> 00:15:15.956
You bastard! How did you realize?

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.752
'Cause I've never seen
such an ugly-looking bat before.

00:15:19.835 --> 00:15:20.669
Duh.

00:15:22.588 --> 00:15:24.548
What are you doing to me?

00:15:25.549 --> 00:15:29.678
Vampires turn into ash
when they're exposed to sunlight.

00:15:29.762 --> 00:15:31.889
However, they say
that the vampire's spirit

00:15:31.972 --> 00:15:33.933
will rise from the ashes as a bat.

00:15:34.016 --> 00:15:37.645
He returns to his coffin
and sucks in the spirits of the earth.

00:15:37.728 --> 00:15:41.649
Then, two days later, the bat is reborn
in the form of a vampire.

00:15:42.232 --> 00:15:44.109
Isn't that right?

00:15:45.277 --> 00:15:46.820
What are you going to do?

00:15:46.904 --> 00:15:50.324
Are you… are you going to kill me now?

00:15:50.407 --> 00:15:52.701
Let's not get ahead
of ourselves.

00:15:52.785 --> 00:15:54.286
First, I'm gonna cast a spell.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:58.207
And this little piece of flesh right here
is gonna be my catalyst.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:01.710
Even if you are a vampire,
the spell will definitely work.

00:16:03.295 --> 00:16:07.091
This is one of my all-time favorites.

00:16:07.174 --> 00:16:10.678
Anyone subjected to it is doomed to fall.

00:16:10.761 --> 00:16:14.139
It's an evil spell from ancient times.

00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:16.225
No! Stop it! Stop it!

00:16:16.308 --> 00:16:18.602
Please, don't do this!

00:16:18.686 --> 00:16:23.857
Di-amon, you're an evil,
tough, arrogant, cruel, and funny man.

00:16:23.941 --> 00:16:27.528
Quite frankly, I haven't decided
what I should do with you.

00:16:27.611 --> 00:16:31.490
So I'll give you a chance
to choose whether you live or die.

00:16:32.074 --> 00:16:34.827
O kings of the splatter rock,

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:37.579
come forth on the wings of this bat.

00:16:37.663 --> 00:16:42.376
O demon of the night,
enter my nail, and seal our pact.

00:16:45.045 --> 00:16:49.008
Using this blue nail, I'll dig the spell
directly into your body.

00:16:49.091 --> 00:16:50.634
It'll be a part of you.

00:16:50.718 --> 00:16:52.678
If you attempt to disobey me,

00:16:52.761 --> 00:16:55.723
or if you ever try
to pull the nail out of your body,

00:16:55.806 --> 00:17:00.102
then this blue nail is going
to turn purple, and eventually turn red.

00:17:00.185 --> 00:17:04.064
The moment it becomes crimson red,
you will breathe your last breath,

00:17:04.648 --> 00:17:06.734
Your body will be shredded into pieces,

00:17:06.817 --> 00:17:09.528
put back together
in the form of a hideous creature,

00:17:09.611 --> 00:17:11.864
and you will never be reborn again.

00:17:11.947 --> 00:17:15.784
How do you feel about being
a disgusting and helpless toad?

00:17:18.746 --> 00:17:21.373
Stop, please! Have mercy on me!

00:17:21.457 --> 00:17:24.585
Mercy? I don't have that.

00:17:24.668 --> 00:17:26.211
Accused!

00:17:33.052 --> 00:17:34.470
Stop it! Stop it!

00:17:39.183 --> 00:17:42.269
How nice!
I love the sound of your screaming!

00:17:42.352 --> 00:17:43.854
I love it! Come on!

00:17:43.937 --> 00:17:46.148
Please, keep screaming for me!

00:17:52.613 --> 00:17:54.239
I hate you! I hate you!

00:17:54.323 --> 00:17:55.616
I hate you!

00:17:55.699 --> 00:17:57.201
You understand?

00:17:57.284 --> 00:18:00.287
If you even think about disobeying me,

00:18:00.788 --> 00:18:03.165
you will become a toad!

00:18:03.248 --> 00:18:06.543
Oh my gosh!
He's such a demon! He's so cruel!

00:18:06.627 --> 00:18:09.129
Let's run away! He's gonna kill us!

00:18:13.675 --> 00:18:15.886
That took longer than I expected it to.

00:18:16.678 --> 00:18:18.347
But at least I'm done with him.

00:18:21.892 --> 00:18:23.769
Dark Schneider!

00:18:23.852 --> 00:18:25.312
Uh…

00:18:25.813 --> 00:18:29.108
It's Kai. Kai's hurt. Please help!

00:18:37.032 --> 00:18:38.575
She's gonna be just fine.

00:18:38.659 --> 00:18:40.828
If you get her treated
at the temple by tomorrow,

00:18:40.911 --> 00:18:42.996
she won't turn into a vampire.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.790
She's one of Arshes' followers.

00:18:44.873 --> 00:18:46.875
And we all know how tough they can be.

00:18:46.959 --> 00:18:49.128
Oh good. Thank goodness!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.049
Now Yoko, why don't you show me
where they kicked you.

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:56.510
Huh? Oh, I'm fine.

00:18:56.593 --> 00:18:58.428
But you were bleeding.

00:19:02.307 --> 00:19:03.350
Come on!

00:19:04.017 --> 00:19:06.687
Ugh! Ew! Stop it!

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:09.523
Come on!
Don't move, or I'll miss the spot!

00:19:09.606 --> 00:19:13.360
I said that I'm fine!
Can you please stop licking me?

00:19:17.156 --> 00:19:18.532
Dark Schneider!

00:19:18.615 --> 00:19:21.743
So, um, who's this girl?

00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:24.621
Who? Do you mean Yoko?

00:19:25.164 --> 00:19:26.915
Yes. Who is she?

00:19:26.999 --> 00:19:28.125
Mm.

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:31.587
Yoko is the woman
who's going to bear my children someday!

00:19:35.465 --> 00:19:39.052
Yeah. That's not gonna happen!
There is nothing going on between us!

00:19:39.136 --> 00:19:40.888
The two of us are just friends.

00:19:41.555 --> 00:19:43.390
Wait. Why would you say that?

00:19:43.473 --> 00:19:45.184
We're, like, a thing!

00:19:45.267 --> 00:19:47.519
Shut up! I'm telling the truth!

00:19:47.603 --> 00:19:49.688
If you were more like Lucien,
it would be different.

00:19:49.771 --> 00:19:51.523
Hey… Well… Wait.
What are you talking about?

00:19:52.608 --> 00:19:54.026
But I'm so confused.

00:19:54.109 --> 00:19:56.778
I don't understand why you told me
I was beautiful the other night.

00:19:56.862 --> 00:19:59.031
Why did you hold me
when we were in bed together?

00:19:59.114 --> 00:20:00.991
-Were you just playing around?
-Huh?

00:20:02.117 --> 00:20:05.287
Why do you care?
Besides, you're the one who came onto me!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.873
It's my policy not to refuse an overture.

00:20:07.956 --> 00:20:10.250
We didn't even go all the way
and seal the deal.

00:20:10.334 --> 00:20:12.002
What? How could you?

00:20:13.795 --> 00:20:16.215
I have absolutely no idea
what you've been up to,

00:20:16.298 --> 00:20:18.675
but you don't have to act
like such a bastard to her!

00:20:18.759 --> 00:20:19.801
That was very mean.

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:23.305
That hurt.

00:20:27.142 --> 00:20:28.894
Majinken!

00:20:33.065 --> 00:20:34.608
Bring it on, you fools!

00:20:35.192 --> 00:20:37.069
I'll hack you into little pieces!

00:20:42.532 --> 00:20:44.326
That cretin!

00:20:44.409 --> 00:20:45.619
We've got the best of the best

00:20:45.702 --> 00:20:48.330
from the Dark Rebel Army
all gathered here,

00:20:48.413 --> 00:20:50.374
but we're still no match for him!

00:20:50.457 --> 00:20:51.833
That monster!

00:20:51.917 --> 00:20:53.377
Hey! Listen up!

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.878
Let's charge!

00:21:00.968 --> 00:21:02.427
Damn you, Gara.

00:21:02.928 --> 00:21:04.930
Did you really have to betray us?

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:07.641
I'm not surprised
he changed sides.

00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:10.269
In any case, I'll eliminate him myself.

00:21:10.352 --> 00:21:14.231
So far, the Three Sorcerer Generals
have all fallen to Dark Schneider.

00:21:14.314 --> 00:21:16.316
Do you understand this Arshes Nei?

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:20.362
And what makes that even worse is that
all three of them have switched sides

00:21:20.445 --> 00:21:22.489
and are under his control now.

00:21:22.572 --> 00:21:26.326
I sincerely hope
we will not encounter any more traitors.

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:28.745
What exactly are you implying, Abigail?

00:21:28.829 --> 00:21:30.706
Nothing, Empress.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:34.251
But knowing your past relationship
with the wizard,

00:21:34.334 --> 00:21:37.254
it is possible
you could fall under his spell.

00:21:37.337 --> 00:21:40.299
You were raised
by Dark Schneider, weren't you?

00:21:40.382 --> 00:21:43.969
Don't be a fool!
Are you doubting my loyalties?

00:21:44.052 --> 00:21:46.805
I don't care who you are,
I won't let you accuse me.

00:21:46.888 --> 00:21:47.931
Understand?

00:21:48.015 --> 00:21:49.057
Hmm.

00:21:49.933 --> 00:21:52.561
Well, I did bring a bat wing here with me.

00:21:53.353 --> 00:21:54.813
You'll use the Accused spell?

00:21:58.483 --> 00:22:02.237
Arshes Nei, are you willing
to prove your loyalty to us

00:22:02.321 --> 00:22:06.950
by undergoing the Accused spell,
and being in my control?

00:22:07.034 --> 00:22:09.036
Ugh. Very well.

00:22:09.119 --> 00:22:13.332
I shall prove to you that I am no longer
Dark Schneider's adopted daughter!

00:22:13.415 --> 00:22:14.875
Hmm.
